## C1 manifest, version 2

The C1 manifest (version 1, `results/c1/nuaa_manifest.csv`, SHA-256 `{c1_v1_sha}`) is frozen: it is the manifest
delivered with C1 and used by R2. Its `session` column holds the 3rd field of the file name on disk (the glasses field)
instead of the capture session (5th field): equal to the glasses field for {c1_glasses} of {c1_n} rows (values
{c1_v1_values}). Version 2 (`nuaa_c1_v2.csv`, SHA-256 `{c1_v2_sha}`) renames the column `file` to `key` and re-parses
every field from the file name: session values {c1_sessions}. Keys, labels, subjects, SHA-256 and bytes are unchanged.

